Gain the Haunt ability:

{icon:403501}
Send a ghostly soul to assault your current target, dealing 125 damage, and increasing all Shadow damage over time you deal to that target by 10% for 12 sec. When Haunt expires for any reason you will be healed for 100% of the damage it dealt to your target.

Gain the Soul Siphon ability:

{icon:403511}
Increases health drained or damage done by your Drain Life, Drain Soul, and Wrack spells by 20%.

Gain the Master Channeler ability:

{icon:403668}
