Gain the Wild Strikes ability:

{icon:407977}
While you are in Cat Form, Bear Form, or Dire Bear Form, party or raid members within 100 yards gain increased combat ferocity.  Each melee hit has a 20% chance of granting the attacker an extra attack with 20% additional Attack Power. No effect if the target is already benefitting from Windfury Totem.

Gain the Wild Growth ability:

{icon:408120}
Heals the target and their party for 336 over 7 sec. Party members must be within 43.5 yards of target. The amount healed is applied quickly at first, and slows down as Wild Growth reaches its full duration.

Gain the Nature's Fury ability:

{icon:408307}
Increases your healing power by 90% of your Nature spell damage for 30 sec.

Gain the Dreamstate ability:

{icon:408258}
Your damaging non-periodic spell critical strikes grant you 50% of your mana regeneration while casting for 8 sec.

Gain the Fury of Stormrage ability:

{icon:414799}
Reduces the mana cost of Wrath by 100% and each time you deal damage with Wrath you have a 12% chance for your next cast of Healing Touch within 15 sec to be instant and castable in any shapeshift form. Allows Wrath to be cast while in Tree of Life form.

Gain the Hammer of the Righteous ability:

{icon:407632}
Hammer the current target and up to 3 additional nearby targets, causing Holy damage to each equal to 3 times the damage per second of your main hand weapon. Cooldown shared with Crusader Strike.

Gain the Avenging Wrath ability:

{icon:407788}
Increases all damage and healing caused by 20% for 20 sec.  Causes Forbearance and cannot be used while Forebearance is active.

Gain the Hand of Sacrifice ability:

{icon:462853}
Causes target party or raid member to transfer 30% of damage taken to the caster.  Lasts 12 sec or until the caster has transferred 100% of their maximum health.

Gain the Fire Nova ability, replacing your Fire Nova Totem:

{icon:408339}
Your Fire Nova Totem spell is replaced with Fire Nova, which causes your current Fire totem to emit damage at its location.

Gain the Dual Wield Specialization ability:

{icon:408496}
Increases your chance to hit with both spells and melee attacks by 5% while dual wielding, your Stormstrike ability now hits with both weapons while dual wielding, and increases the damage done by your offhand weapon by 60%.

Gain the Ancestral Guidance ability:

{icon:409324}
For the next 10 sec, 25% of your damage is converted to healing on up to 3 nearby party members, and 100% of your healing is converted to damage on your most recent Flame Shock target.

Gain the Overload ability:

{icon:408438}
Gives your Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning spells a 30% chance to cast a second, similar spell on the same target at no additional cost that causes half damage and no threat.

Gain the Maelstrom Weapon ability:

{icon:408498}
When you deal damage with a melee attack, you have a chance to reduce the cast time and Mana cost of your next Lightning Bolt spell by 20%. Stacks up to 5 times. Lasts 30 sec.

Gain the Spirit of the Alpha ability:

{icon:408696}
Infuses the target with the spirit of an alpha wolf, increasing all threat generated by the target by 45% for 30 min. Limit 1 target. If cast on a target other than self, the Shaman also gains Loyal Beta, increasing Physical damage done by 5% and reducing all threat generated by 30% for 30 min. A target cannot have both Spirit of the Alpha and Loyal Beta at the same time.

Gain the Lava Lash ability:

{icon:408507}
You charge your off-hand weapon with lava, instantly dealing 100% off-hand Weapon damage. Damage is increased by 100% if your off-hand weapon is enchanted with Flametongue.

Gain the Way of Earth ability:

{icon:408531}
While Rockbiter Weapon is active on your main hand weapon and you have a shield equipped, you deal 65% increased threat, gain 30% increased health, take 10% reduced damage, gain 6% reduced chance to be critically hit by melee attacks, and Earth Shock taunts targets to attack you and has a separate cooldown from other Shock spells but has its range reduced to melee range. However, the range of your Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, Chain Heal, Healing Wave, and Lava Burst spells is reduced by 20 yards.

Gain the Steady Shot ability:

{icon:437123}
