Gain the Lock and Load ability:

{icon:415413}
Each time you place a trap, your next Shot (except Scatter Shot) ability within 20 sec costs no mana and does not incur a cooldown.

Gain the Melee Specialist ability:

{icon:415352}
Your Raptor Strike is now instant, and Mongoose Bite and Raptor Strike have a 30% chance on each attack to reset the cooldowns of Mongoose Bite and Raptor Strike.

